---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Vraj Patel"
  description="About Vraj Patel, a backend and ML systems engineer completing dual M.S. programs at CU Boulder."
>
  <header class="max-w-3xl pb-10 sm:pb-14">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Profile</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
      About
    </h1>
  </header>

  <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr] md:gap-16">
    <aside class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
      <dl class="space-y-5">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Location</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">Boulder, Colorado</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Work</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">CU Boulder · Institute of Behavioral Science</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Study</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">Dual M.S. programs · CU Boulder</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <nav aria-label="Professional links" class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-2">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vrajmp/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-ph-event="social_profile_clicked"
          data-ph-network="linkedin"
          class="underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600 dark:decoration-slate-700 dark:hover:text-blue-400"
        >LinkedIn</a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/PatVraj"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-ph-event="social_profile_clicked"
          data-ph-network="github"
          class="underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600 dark:decoration-slate-700 dark:hover:text-blue-400"
        >GitHub</a>
        <a
          href="/resume.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-ph-event="resume_clicked"
          data-ph-placement="about"
          class="underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600 dark:decoration-slate-700 dark:hover:text-blue-400"
        >Resume</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <div class="min-w-0">
      <section aria-labelledby="background-heading">
        <h2 id="background-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
          Background
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 sm:text-lg">
          <p>
            I’m a systems integration engineer at CU Boulder’s Institute of
            Behavioral Science, where I build backend services, automation, and
            a ticket-classification platform.
          </p>
          <p>
            I continued CU Boulder Studio Lab research remotely with the former
            PI after they moved to Princeton; that collaboration concluded in
            May 2026. The work covered four decades of parliamentary records
            and campaign audio, combining data engineering, applied NLP, and
            the less glamorous job of making long-running pipelines recover
            cleanly.
          </p>
          <p>
            I’m completing dual M.S. programs in Computer Science and Engineering
            Management at CU Boulder, where I earned a B.S. in Computer Science
            with a Business minor. Outside work, I run a 24 TB TrueNAS and Docker
            home lab, mostly to learn by operating the systems I build.
          </p>
          <p>
            I’m also developing a paper on secure GitHub repository collaboration
            for work governed by federal data-protection agreements.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-12 border-t border-slate-200 pt-9 dark:border-slate-800" aria-labelledby="current-heading">
        <h2 id="current-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
          Current
        </h2>
        <dl class="mt-6">
          <div class="grid gap-1 border-t border-slate-200 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-8 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-medium text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Systems Integration Engineer</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">University of Colorado Boulder · Institute of Behavioral Science</dd>
            </div>
            <dd class="font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">2025—present</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 border-t border-slate-200 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-8 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-medium text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Dual M.S. programs</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">University of Colorado Boulder · Computer Science and Engineering Management</dd>
            </div>
            <dd class="font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">In progress</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 border-t border-slate-200 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-8 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-medium text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Research paper in progress</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Secure GitHub collaboration for work governed by federal data-protection agreements</dd>
            </div>
            <dd class="font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">In progress</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 pt-9 dark:border-slate-800" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
        <h2 id="focus-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
          Focus
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Backend systems, data engineering, applied NLP, model deployment, and
          self-hosted infrastructure. I work primarily in Python, TypeScript,
          PostgreSQL, Docker, and AWS.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
